This product combines two previously separate projects, both Apache-2.0:

  Moorgate  https://github.com/kforbus3/Moorgate
            SSH/RDP fleet management, jump host, overlay, RBAC, audit.
            This repository carries its full history.

  Flipside  https://github.com/kforbus3/flipside
            A/B operating-system image builder, PXE imaging server, signed
            RAUC update bundles, and the fleet control plane that rolls them
            out. Its builder, imager and provisioning server are carried
            across unchanged; its control plane is reimplemented here against
            this product's own database, identity and audit trail.
